WEBVTT

00:11.050 --> 00:12.110
-Calm down!
-Stay back!

00:12.110 --> 00:13.240
-Calm down!
-Back off!

00:13.240 --> 00:14.060
Step back!

00:14.400 --> 00:14.750
Don't move!

00:14.750 --> 00:15.350
Don't move!

00:15.350 --> 00:16.010
Don't move!

00:16.070 --> 00:16.640
Nobody move!

00:16.640 --> 00:17.700
Put the knife down!

00:17.760 --> 00:18.440
Put the knife down!

00:18.440 --> 00:19.120
Nobody move!

00:19.120 --> 00:19.800
-Calm down!
-Back off!

00:19.800 --> 00:20.710
I told you to put the knife down!

00:20.710 --> 00:21.710
Step back! Step back!

00:21.710 --> 00:22.430
Calm down!

00:22.550 --> 00:22.870
Don't move!

00:22.870 --> 00:23.470
Calm down!

00:23.480 --> 00:24.350
Don't come any closer!

00:24.350 --> 00:25.600
-Calm down!
-Don't come over!

00:25.600 --> 00:26.660
Put the knife down!

00:26.870 --> 00:27.350
Quiet!

00:27.710 --> 00:30.310
[Zhang Yi'ang, Investigator of Ping'an Province,
Ping'an City Public Security Bureau]

00:31.350 --> 00:33.350
Don't provoke him. Let me handle it.

00:33.390 --> 00:34.280
Hello, bro.

00:35.430 --> 00:36.440
Relax. It's okay.

00:36.470 --> 00:37.640
Relax. Don't... Come on.

00:37.640 --> 00:38.390
Let me tell you.

00:38.390 --> 00:39.790
Life is precious.

00:40.350 --> 00:40.920
You only live once.

00:40.920 --> 00:42.180
You have just one life.

00:42.280 --> 00:43.470
It's the most precious gift

00:43.470 --> 00:44.790
your mother gave you.

00:44.920 --> 00:46.180
Don't come any closer!

00:48.560 --> 00:49.160
Stay back!

00:49.520 --> 00:50.920
Don't take another step!

00:50.920 --> 00:51.240
Or else

00:51.240 --> 00:53.300
I'll jump down and join her right now.

00:56.520 --> 00:58.450
Because I could not stop for Death,

01:00.280 --> 01:02.280
he kindly stopped for me.

01:03.390 --> 01:05.519
The Carriage held but just Ourselves.

01:06.430 --> 01:07.500
In this carriage,

01:08.789 --> 01:10.220
it's just the three of us.

01:10.400 --> 01:11.490
Three?

01:11.560 --> 01:12.490
Can't you count?

01:14.680 --> 01:15.039
This is

01:15.039 --> 01:16.560
a poem by Emily Dickinson—

01:16.640 --> 01:17.310
"Because

01:18.200 --> 01:19.750
I Could Not Stop for Death."

01:20.300 --> 01:21.320
Look, bro.

01:21.710 --> 01:23.410
Poetry is urging you to stay.

01:23.920 --> 01:25.070
The drizzle is urging you to stay.

01:25.070 --> 01:27.310
The sunset and dawn
are urging you to stay.

01:27.310 --> 01:28.310
And so am I.

01:28.350 --> 01:29.760
I don't need you to do that!

01:29.760 --> 01:31.020
I'm jumping right now.

01:31.680 --> 01:32.930
Dying is easy.

01:33.150 --> 01:34.479
It doesn't take much resolve.

01:34.479 --> 01:35.070
For instance,

01:35.070 --> 01:36.310
with the distance between us,

01:36.310 --> 01:38.110
if I accidentally pushed you...

03:03.060 --> 03:06.810
[Born with Luck]

03:06.890 --> 03:09.810
[Episode 1]

03:10.700 --> 03:14.440
[Five years later]

03:14.690 --> 03:17.130
[July 18, 2012]

03:16.120 --> 03:17.430
These two suspects

03:18.190 --> 03:20.150
are estimated
to be around 1.8 meters tall.

03:20.150 --> 03:21.950
One is fat, and the other is thin.

03:22.520 --> 03:23.980
Judging from the footage,

03:24.000 --> 03:25.000
their motive

03:25.000 --> 03:25.560
was likely

03:25.560 --> 03:26.750
not robbery.

03:27.000 --> 03:29.170
They were more likely
trying to cause a disturbance,

03:29.170 --> 03:30.360
[Gao Dong, Deputy Director
of Ping'an Provincial Public Security Department]

03:29.260 --> 03:30.310
vent their frustration,

03:30.310 --> 03:30.910
and lash out at society.

03:30.390 --> 03:31.380
[Chief
of Ping'an City Public Security Bureau]

03:34.990 --> 03:41.560
[July 18, 2012]

03:35.590 --> 03:36.240
A month ago,

03:36.240 --> 03:37.300
they robbed a bank.

03:37.630 --> 03:38.740
But in the end,

03:38.840 --> 03:40.570
they didn't take a single cent.

03:45.310 --> 03:46.770
What if they didn't notice

03:46.800 --> 03:47.810
the door was open?

03:48.360 --> 03:49.560
Are you saying

03:49.630 --> 03:51.310
all these experts
from the Provincial Department

03:50.329 --> 03:53.670
[Yan Liang, Captain of the CID
of Ping'an Province,
Ping'an City Public Security Bureau]

03:51.430 --> 03:52.190
and the investigators

03:52.190 --> 03:54.520
are dealing with just two stupid thieves?

03:57.840 --> 03:59.170
This is a case briefing.

04:00.080 --> 04:00.590
Everyone should feel free

04:00.590 --> 04:02.060
to share their thoughts.

04:02.310 --> 04:02.770
Li Qian,

04:03.000 --> 04:03.660
keep going.

04:04.680 --> 04:06.940
I'm just offering another perspective.

04:07.730 --> 04:09.800
After all, from a

04:08.790 --> 04:11.630
[Li Qian, Investigator of Ping'an Province,
Ping'an City Public Security Bureau]

04:09.820 --> 04:11.080
criminal psychology standpoint,

04:11.080 --> 04:11.940
people

04:12.000 --> 04:13.990
committing a robbery

04:14.360 --> 04:16.019
are usually highly nervous.

04:16.120 --> 04:16.769
So they...

04:16.800 --> 04:17.480
So...

04:17.560 --> 04:18.390
they failed,

04:18.410 --> 04:20.630
but drew the police's attention.

04:21.800 --> 04:22.310
Well, Li Qian,

04:22.310 --> 04:23.570
following your logic,

04:23.630 --> 04:24.330
if you were

04:24.360 --> 04:25.240
the suspect,

04:25.430 --> 04:26.690
what would you do next?

04:27.750 --> 04:28.240
Run.

04:28.480 --> 04:30.070
Go to another city to strike again.

04:30.070 --> 04:30.670
Very well.

04:31.680 --> 04:32.240
However,

04:33.240 --> 04:34.510
this is recent footage

04:34.560 --> 04:35.420
of the suspects

04:35.430 --> 04:36.560
captured by Skynet.

04:37.630 --> 04:39.220
There are Huashang Bank on Minxing Road,

04:37.909 --> 04:39.390
[Huashang Bank]

04:39.440 --> 04:41.450
[Chengxin Pawnshop]

04:39.600 --> 04:41.630
Chengxin Pawnshop
on the commercial street,

04:41.630 --> 04:42.170
and

04:42.360 --> 04:44.430
Caifu Jewelry Store at this intersection.

04:44.430 --> 04:45.060
Here.

04:44.650 --> 04:45.320
[Bank vault]

04:45.770 --> 04:47.770
Near the vault in the East District.

04:47.950 --> 04:49.480
They are casing the joints.

04:49.510 --> 04:51.070
They still want to strike
in the provincial capital?

04:51.070 --> 04:51.650
Exactly.

04:53.159 --> 04:55.430
Are stupid thieves really this stupid?

04:56.159 --> 04:57.360
Other than deliberate sabotage,

04:57.360 --> 04:59.020
I have no better explanation.

04:59.560 --> 05:00.560
Do you have a response plan?

05:00.560 --> 05:01.110
Yes.

05:01.720 --> 05:03.020
I need everyone

05:03.040 --> 05:03.970
to split into groups,

05:03.970 --> 05:05.010
[Chengxin Pawnshop]

05:04.160 --> 05:05.920
keep close surveillance,
and maintain strict vigilance.

05:05.050 --> 05:06.070
[Wuzhou Gold Store]

05:06.000 --> 05:07.280
Once the two suspects are spotted,

05:06.130 --> 05:07.060
[Caifu Jewelry Store]

05:07.310 --> 05:08.640
you must take them down.

05:08.750 --> 05:09.310
Now,

05:09.390 --> 05:10.830
I will lay out the operational plan.

05:10.830 --> 05:11.230
Team 1.

05:11.270 --> 05:11.680
Here.

05:11.920 --> 05:12.730
You're in charge of
the Rural Commercial Bank.

05:12.730 --> 05:13.260
Yes, sir.

05:13.360 --> 05:13.760
Team 2.

05:13.830 --> 05:14.160
Here.

05:14.190 --> 05:15.000
Chengxin Pawnshop.

05:15.000 --> 05:15.310
Yes, sir.

05:15.310 --> 05:15.830
Team 3.

05:15.920 --> 05:16.310
Here.

05:16.510 --> 05:17.560
Caifu Jewelry Store.

05:17.560 --> 05:18.090
Yes, sir.

05:18.120 --> 05:19.560
Wuzhou Gold Store?

05:21.160 --> 05:21.720
Director.

05:21.720 --> 05:22.480
Leave the frontline work

05:22.480 --> 05:23.510
to the frontline police.

05:23.510 --> 05:25.240
You just stay here and command.

05:25.830 --> 05:27.410
This Zhang Yi'ang.

05:30.310 --> 05:31.110
Wait a minute!

05:31.720 --> 05:32.700
Don't shoot!

05:33.040 --> 05:34.000
Don't shoot!

05:40.190 --> 05:40.930
Wait!

05:44.510 --> 05:45.240
Wait!

05:44.630 --> 05:46.680
[Fighting]

05:50.360 --> 05:51.070
Wait!

05:51.370 --> 05:51.800
Don't!

05:57.190 --> 05:58.070
Director Zhang,

05:58.070 --> 05:58.870
what's wrong?

05:59.730 --> 06:00.850
[Zhang Yi'ang]

06:00.880 --> 06:02.010
[Director of Veteran Cadre Bureau
of Ping'an City Public Security Bureau, Ping'an Province]

06:02.360 --> 06:04.310
I'm not ready yet, but...

06:04.680 --> 06:06.510
I think the starting gun just went off.

06:06.510 --> 06:07.950
The starting gun went off?

06:07.950 --> 06:08.760
Director Guo.

06:09.000 --> 06:10.630
I think the starting gun just went off.

06:10.630 --> 06:11.870
The starting gun went off?

06:11.870 --> 06:13.120
Let's run.

06:13.360 --> 06:14.160
Let's run.

06:14.240 --> 06:15.430
It really did. Let's run.

06:15.430 --> 06:16.480
Let's go.

06:16.520 --> 06:18.930
[2012 "Different Police"]

06:17.390 --> 06:18.160
Be careful.

06:18.960 --> 06:20.710
[Ping'an Provincial Public Security Department
Marathon]

06:19.270 --> 06:20.270
It hasn't started yet.

06:20.270 --> 06:21.730
Don't rush. Wait a moment.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.180
Don't rush.

06:24.560 --> 06:25.800
I told you not to ru—

06:26.310 --> 06:27.830
What's the hurry?

06:29.630 --> 06:30.890
Where is Director Guo?

06:38.270 --> 06:38.920
Where is Director Guo?

06:38.920 --> 06:40.320
Did you see Director Guo?

06:43.120 --> 06:45.909
Come on!

06:58.870 --> 06:59.920
Who told you to take them

06:59.920 --> 07:00.850
to the marathon?

07:01.510 --> 07:02.600
That bunch of old men together

07:02.600 --> 07:04.200
is over a thousand years old.

07:05.270 --> 07:06.640
Didn't you tell me

07:06.720 --> 07:07.870
that retirement doesn't mean fading away,

07:07.870 --> 07:09.040
but starting a new journey?

07:09.040 --> 07:09.510
Is this

07:10.000 --> 07:11.620
how you start a new journey?

07:12.560 --> 07:13.310
Zhang Yi'ang.

07:13.310 --> 07:14.360
You've only just been transferred

07:14.360 --> 07:14.950
to the Veteran Cadre Bureau,

07:14.950 --> 07:16.190
and this has already happened 3 times.

07:16.190 --> 07:16.600
Yes.

07:17.000 --> 07:17.750
They are

07:17.750 --> 07:19.120
valuable assets
to our public security officers,

07:19.120 --> 07:19.780
priceless.

07:19.800 --> 07:21.070
How could they be messed around like that?

07:21.070 --> 07:21.830
Director Gao,

07:21.830 --> 07:23.560
Director Zhang... meant well.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.370
He's always been a jinx.

07:25.680 --> 07:27.310
Wherever he goes, trouble follows.

07:27.310 --> 07:28.040
Don't worry.

07:28.310 --> 07:29.310
I've arranged for Director Guo

07:29.310 --> 07:30.910
to stay in the best hospital.

07:31.000 --> 07:32.330
What did the doctor say?

07:33.360 --> 07:34.040
The good news

07:34.040 --> 07:36.100
is his vital signs are stable for now.

07:36.159 --> 07:37.290
So there's bad news?

07:38.630 --> 07:39.510
Not really bad.

07:39.560 --> 07:40.430
It's just that...

07:40.430 --> 07:41.750
he hasn't woken up yet.

07:42.600 --> 07:43.530
You... Zhang...

07:44.800 --> 07:45.390
Before I retired,

07:45.390 --> 07:46.390
what was I thinking

07:46.390 --> 07:48.050
when I took you as my disciple?

07:51.950 --> 07:53.210
Why are you still here?

07:53.310 --> 07:55.800
Get to the hospital
and handle the situation!

07:55.800 --> 07:56.120
Go!

07:56.270 --> 07:57.400
Yes, yes, I'm going.

07:57.920 --> 07:58.520
I'm going.

08:00.930 --> 08:02.280
Playing basketball?

08:01.390 --> 08:08.530
[Emergency Room]

08:02.830 --> 08:03.390
Yeah.

08:04.000 --> 08:04.480
Tell me about it.

08:04.480 --> 08:06.120
We didn't notice it before.

08:06.920 --> 08:08.270
How could this happen?

08:08.800 --> 08:09.680
It just happened so suddenly.

08:09.680 --> 08:10.740
There shouldn't be

08:10.830 --> 08:12.370
any major problems.

08:12.690 --> 08:14.490
He just needs some rest and care.

08:19.690 --> 08:22.140
[Emergency Room Exit]

08:28.560 --> 08:29.490
Have some water.

08:32.470 --> 08:33.980
It's my fault. I'm sorry.

08:34.200 --> 08:34.830
Zhang,

08:35.150 --> 08:36.360
don't say that.

08:37.080 --> 08:37.970
You meant well

08:38.000 --> 08:40.320
in organizing the activity for everyone.

08:40.320 --> 08:40.789
Yes.

08:43.110 --> 08:44.310
Don't worry too much.

08:44.910 --> 08:46.150
Director Guo's physical condition

08:46.150 --> 08:47.030
is usually quite good.

08:47.030 --> 08:48.030
He will definitely be...

08:48.030 --> 08:49.960
It'd be better if he never wakes up.

08:50.540 --> 08:53.200
Then I wouldn't have to worry about him
anymore.

08:53.750 --> 08:55.600
You're just saying that out of anger.

08:55.600 --> 08:56.480
Let's not say things in anger.

08:56.480 --> 08:57.880
It's bad for your health.

08:58.720 --> 09:01.150
People should know their own limits.

09:01.670 --> 09:03.000
He's just an old man.

09:03.030 --> 09:04.690
Why did he try to play the hero?

09:06.270 --> 09:07.760
I don't know

09:07.960 --> 09:09.960
who's been feeding him sweet words,

09:10.080 --> 09:11.480
telling him things like
"An old steed in the stable

09:11.480 --> 09:13.880
still aspires to gallop a thousand miles."

09:15.840 --> 09:16.800
This runner

09:16.900 --> 09:18.370
is Director Guo,

09:18.670 --> 09:20.510
the former Executive Deputy Director of

09:20.510 --> 09:22.080
the Provincial Public Security Department.

09:22.080 --> 09:22.920
As they say,

09:23.030 --> 09:25.390
"An old steed in the stable still aspires
to gallop a thousand miles."

09:25.390 --> 09:27.720
They said he was the leader
of the department

09:27.720 --> 09:29.150
and they couldn't do without him.

09:29.150 --> 09:29.950
Director Guo,

09:30.190 --> 09:31.740
before you retired,

09:31.870 --> 09:33.550
you were the leader of our department.

09:33.550 --> 09:34.600
So today,

09:34.650 --> 09:35.980
you can't fall behind.

09:37.150 --> 09:37.720
I won't.

09:37.910 --> 09:39.110
That's the attitude.

09:39.360 --> 09:41.380
I told him to take it easy.

09:41.870 --> 09:43.320
Guess what he said?

09:44.080 --> 09:44.840
He said he must bring out

09:44.840 --> 09:46.990
the same energy he had when chasing
drug dealers back in the day.

09:46.990 --> 09:48.370
You must bring out the same energy you had

09:48.370 --> 09:49.570
when chasing drug dealers back in the day.

09:49.570 --> 09:50.160
Okay?

09:51.670 --> 09:52.700
Just watch!

09:52.790 --> 09:53.210
Okay!

09:53.320 --> 09:54.120
Yi'ang.

09:54.240 --> 09:55.900
The finish line is just ahead.

09:56.080 --> 09:57.330
When you cross it,

09:57.510 --> 09:58.280
shout

09:58.600 --> 09:59.790
"We are victorious!"

09:59.790 --> 10:01.440
Like Pheidippides did.

10:01.720 --> 10:02.440
We... We are...

10:02.440 --> 10:03.240
Director Guo!

10:04.390 --> 10:05.190
Director Guo!

10:06.150 --> 10:06.670
Doctor!

10:06.750 --> 10:08.030
-Director Guo!
-Doctor!

10:08.030 --> 10:09.110
What happened?

10:09.240 --> 10:10.100
He deserved it.

10:10.960 --> 10:12.480
He brought it on himself.

10:14.390 --> 10:16.070
In the end, it's still my fault.

10:16.070 --> 10:16.870
It's my fault.

10:22.840 --> 10:23.360
Doctor,

10:23.670 --> 10:24.320
how is he?

10:24.670 --> 10:26.270
Don't worry. He's awake.

10:50.790 --> 10:53.950
[Fang Chao, a hardened criminal]

10:52.030 --> 10:52.910
Do you feel

10:52.910 --> 10:53.670
that society nowadays

10:53.670 --> 10:55.600
is getting more and more restless?

10:57.120 --> 10:57.670
Last night,

10:57.670 --> 10:59.600
I went to that foot massage parlor,

11:02.230 --> 11:04.360
and they actually just washed my feet.

11:04.910 --> 11:06.310
What else should they do?

11:06.330 --> 11:07.440
Some foot massage parlors

11:07.440 --> 11:08.510
don't wash feet.

11:10.680 --> 11:13.700
[Liu Zhi, a hardened criminal]

11:11.200 --> 11:14.660
What are foot massage parlors for
if they don't wash your feet?

11:14.840 --> 11:16.500
Once we're done with this job,

11:16.720 --> 11:17.670
I'll take you to experience

11:17.670 --> 11:18.800
a real foot massage.

11:20.320 --> 11:21.910
If a foot massage parlor
doesn't wash feet,

11:21.910 --> 11:24.240
how can it be called
a foot massage parlor?

12:18.670 --> 12:19.870
Brother, let me do it.

12:23.060 --> 12:25.060
You'll drag me down sooner or later.

12:25.390 --> 12:25.920
Brother,

12:25.930 --> 12:27.930
that's called dragging into a well.

12:52.320 --> 12:52.930
Come up.

13:07.910 --> 13:10.110
Many things are actually quite simple.

13:11.390 --> 13:12.390
People just flatter themselves

13:12.390 --> 13:13.990
and overcomplicate things.

13:29.840 --> 13:36.620
[Inpatient Department]

13:30.840 --> 13:35.300
♪ Burning on its own
somewhere between haziness and clarity ♪

13:39.170 --> 13:45.320
♪ In the careless detail,
he touched the color ♪

13:46.270 --> 13:47.000
One pancake.

13:49.520 --> 13:51.590
♪ The show starts getting interesting ♪

13:53.310 --> 13:53.540
♪ Yeah ♪

13:53.970 --> 13:56.090
♪ I wonder who's the real onlooker here ♪

13:58.250 --> 14:00.170
♪ Find the onlooker ♪

13:59.270 --> 14:08.440
[Under Maintenance]

14:04.440 --> 14:07.590
♪ The chance is waiting patiently
in the bowl ♪

14:05.600 --> 14:06.130
Brother.

14:07.120 --> 14:07.850
Are you done?

14:08.270 --> 14:09.780
♪ Who covered my eyes ♪

14:10.360 --> 14:12.280
♪ I'm full of ideas ♪

14:20.320 --> 14:20.850
Brother,

14:21.480 --> 14:22.210
are you done?

14:22.790 --> 14:24.020
Call me Sister.

14:38.200 --> 14:39.240
Nowadays, people like us

14:39.240 --> 14:40.300
who love their work

14:40.670 --> 14:42.150
and strive for ultimate perfection

14:42.150 --> 14:43.060
are really...

14:44.360 --> 14:45.200
too rare.

14:46.080 --> 14:46.740
Wow.

14:47.150 --> 14:48.840
You really look like a woman.

14:52.000 --> 14:52.840
What about me?

14:58.230 --> 15:00.430
You need to put some makeup on this face.

15:01.000 --> 15:02.130
Is there still time?

15:08.470 --> 15:09.730
Ten minutes is enough.

15:17.310 --> 15:18.320
Dear guests,

15:17.520 --> 15:19.000
[To the Craftsmen]

15:18.350 --> 15:19.320
ladies and gentlemen,

15:19.320 --> 15:20.200
good morning.

15:20.480 --> 15:21.630
Welcome to

15:21.750 --> 15:23.510
today's event.

15:23.870 --> 15:25.400
I am your host,

15:25.480 --> 15:26.140
Hong Liang.

15:26.150 --> 15:26.960
Is this you?

15:27.000 --> 15:28.870
Please allow me,
on behalf of the organizers

15:28.870 --> 15:30.720
and all the staff of today's event,

15:30.720 --> 15:32.410
to extend our warmest welcome

15:32.470 --> 15:34.180
to all the guests present.

15:34.240 --> 15:35.330
Take it.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.570
Welcome, everyone.

15:36.630 --> 15:38.380
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

15:38.510 --> 15:39.240
Today,

15:39.240 --> 15:41.750
we have also prepared
many exquisite gifts for you.

15:41.750 --> 15:42.720
Later on,

15:42.720 --> 15:44.150
we will draw lucky guests

15:44.150 --> 15:45.510
and give them away one by one.

15:45.510 --> 15:46.360
Now,

15:46.360 --> 15:48.840
let's give a round of applause
to the performers on stage.

15:48.840 --> 15:50.030
Let's cheer them on

15:50.030 --> 15:51.240
and encourage them.

15:51.360 --> 15:52.910
Bravo!

15:52.910 --> 15:55.360
Come on!

16:02.150 --> 16:03.390
This morning, Guo...

16:03.390 --> 16:04.330
You wanna die?

16:07.390 --> 16:08.050
What?

16:08.080 --> 16:08.840
What happened?

16:08.840 --> 16:09.980
It was now about Guo...

16:09.980 --> 16:11.040
Well, there's a...

16:11.270 --> 16:12.080
I'll talk to you later.

16:12.080 --> 16:13.740
I'm following traffic rules.

16:15.330 --> 16:18.230
[Macau Restaurant]

16:18.630 --> 16:19.240
Alright, everyone.

16:19.240 --> 16:19.930
Now,

16:20.000 --> 16:21.530
let's count down together.

16:21.720 --> 16:22.750
Get ready.

16:22.790 --> 16:23.990
Let's do it together.

16:24.240 --> 16:25.150
Ten seconds.

16:26.030 --> 16:27.080
Ten!

16:27.200 --> 16:28.080
Nine!

16:28.120 --> 16:29.080
Eight!

16:29.240 --> 16:30.120
Seven!

16:30.270 --> 16:31.270
Six!

16:31.510 --> 16:32.350
Five!

16:32.550 --> 16:33.360
Four!

16:33.670 --> 16:34.600
Three!

16:34.910 --> 16:35.750
Two!

16:35.840 --> 16:36.750
[Sports & Lifestyle Center]

16:35.960 --> 16:37.550
One!

16:49.050 --> 16:50.080
[Wuzhou Gold Store]

16:56.360 --> 16:57.920
[Wuzhou Gold Store]

17:07.510 --> 17:08.589
Now, no one will

17:08.589 --> 17:09.720
disturb us.

17:16.630 --> 17:21.609
[Macau Restaurant]

17:23.900 --> 17:27.069
[110 Call Center,
Ping'an City Public Security Bureau]

17:24.640 --> 17:25.970
Hello, 110 Call Center.

17:26.000 --> 17:27.000
How can I help you?

17:27.829 --> 17:29.060
What? Explosion?

17:29.090 --> 17:30.620
Please give me the address.

17:31.270 --> 17:32.180
[Public Security]

17:33.190 --> 17:33.820
[Public Security]

17:43.670 --> 17:44.830
Welcome.

17:46.510 --> 17:47.040
Brother,

17:48.240 --> 17:49.640
they are welcoming us.

17:50.720 --> 17:51.720
This is a robbery.

17:52.640 --> 17:53.870
No, no.

18:09.960 --> 18:10.920
Don't run to this area!

18:10.920 --> 18:12.120
It's dangerous here!

18:12.790 --> 18:13.680
I am a cop!

18:14.310 --> 18:16.240
Please leave in an orderly manner!

18:20.750 --> 18:21.830
I know this is your first time

18:21.830 --> 18:23.830
going through something like this,

18:25.030 --> 18:26.690
and you must be really scared.

18:27.910 --> 18:28.680
You're probably wondering

18:28.680 --> 18:30.280
whether to hand over the key.

18:31.270 --> 18:32.870
Actually, it's very simple.

18:33.440 --> 18:34.970
How much do you earn at work?

18:35.830 --> 18:37.240
Is it really worth risking your life

18:37.240 --> 18:38.570
for such a small salary?

18:39.680 --> 18:40.590
Remember:

18:41.830 --> 18:42.890
your life is yours,

18:43.790 --> 18:45.720
but the money belongs to your boss.

18:50.400 --> 18:52.640
I... I am the boss.

18:53.070 --> 18:53.750
Keys.

18:54.960 --> 18:55.950
Spare my life!

18:56.400 --> 18:57.240
Spare my life!

18:57.310 --> 18:58.440
Spare my life! Here.

19:02.920 --> 19:03.790
Don't run to this area!

19:03.790 --> 19:04.790
It's very dangerous here right now!

19:04.790 --> 19:05.440
Listen to me! Listen to me!

19:05.440 --> 19:06.150
I am a cop!

19:06.200 --> 19:07.260
Go that way! Leave!

19:07.270 --> 19:08.000
Don't panic!

19:08.030 --> 19:09.480
Leave this area in an orderly manner!

19:09.480 --> 19:10.240
Listen to me!

19:10.350 --> 19:11.030
Listen to me!

19:11.030 --> 19:11.750
Go, go.

19:12.110 --> 19:12.510
Okay.

19:14.850 --> 19:17.450
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

19:18.360 --> 19:19.620
♪ I love you, love you, love you ♪

19:20.960 --> 19:22.610
Go around! Go around!

19:21.110 --> 19:23.680
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

19:24.630 --> 19:25.970
♪ I love you, love you, love you ♪

19:27.200 --> 19:28.010
♪ It's easy ♪

19:29.180 --> 19:30.970
♪ Let me bathe in this massive fortune ♪

19:32.240 --> 19:33.760
♪ And make it rain ♪

19:34.190 --> 19:36.830
♪ Cash is my life ♪

19:40.640 --> 19:41.720
Leave. Don't stay here.

19:41.720 --> 19:42.830
Stop filming, will you?

19:42.830 --> 19:43.350
Stop filming.

19:43.350 --> 19:44.270
It's quite dangerous here.

19:44.270 --> 19:45.270
Please leave. Go.

19:46.680 --> 19:47.210
Alright.

19:47.550 --> 19:48.030
Stop looking.

19:48.030 --> 19:49.210
Hurry up and leave.

19:50.790 --> 19:52.050
You two, wait a minute.

19:58.110 --> 19:58.950
Wrong way.

19:59.030 --> 19:59.430
You...

20:00.030 --> 20:01.100
Don't be nervous. I'm a police officer.

20:01.100 --> 20:02.500
Your bag isn't zipped up.

20:03.400 --> 20:04.470
Okay. Don't linger here.

20:04.470 --> 20:05.510
It's dangerous here. Go now.

20:05.510 --> 20:06.040
Hurry up.

20:06.250 --> 20:07.160
Follow the crowd.

20:07.160 --> 20:08.390
Follow the crowd. Go.

20:08.640 --> 20:09.450
Go now. Go.

20:09.510 --> 20:10.270
Hurry up. Stop looking.

20:10.270 --> 20:11.400
Stop looking. Let's go.

20:11.400 --> 20:12.550
Go, go.

20:16.740 --> 20:17.120
[I hereby report, under my real name,
that the death of Lu Zheng, Deputy Chief]

20:17.150 --> 20:17.470
[in charge of criminal investigation
at Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau, six months ago,]

20:17.500 --> 20:17.910
[was not a traffic accident,
but a carefully planned murder.]

20:20.650 --> 20:21.180
[At the bureau meeting
the following day, Director Zhang]

20:21.200 --> 20:21.870
[from the Provincial Department,
implied that...]

20:27.170 --> 20:27.820
[I hereby report, under my real name,
that the death of Lu Zheng, Deputy Chief]

20:27.840 --> 20:28.580
[in charge of criminal investigation
at Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau, six months ago,]

20:28.600 --> 20:29.520
[was not a traffic accident,
but a carefully planned murder.]

20:50.140 --> 20:51.190
[SOS]

20:53.680 --> 20:55.020
According to the jewelry store owner,

20:55.020 --> 20:56.160
both of them should be men.

20:56.160 --> 20:57.550
But one of them was dressed as a woman,

20:57.550 --> 20:58.550
or a transgender.

21:02.000 --> 21:02.720
This was captured by onlookers

21:02.720 --> 21:03.650
on their phones.

21:08.510 --> 21:10.000
The clothing and height
of these two people

21:10.000 --> 21:11.440
match what the owner said.

21:11.440 --> 21:13.570
They are confirmed to be the suspects.

21:15.000 --> 21:16.230
You two, wait a minute.

21:16.230 --> 21:16.920
Wrong way.

21:17.110 --> 21:17.550
You...

21:18.240 --> 21:19.270
Don't be nervous. I'm a police officer.

21:19.270 --> 21:20.670
Your bag isn't zipped up.

21:21.270 --> 21:22.350
Alright. Don't linger here.

21:22.350 --> 21:23.350
It's dangerous here. Go now.

21:23.350 --> 21:23.920
Hurry up.

21:24.200 --> 21:25.030
Follow the crowd.

21:25.030 --> 21:26.030
Follow the crowd.

21:29.200 --> 21:31.160
From the situation at the scene,

21:31.350 --> 21:32.350
Director Zhang

21:32.430 --> 21:32.960
let them go

21:32.960 --> 21:34.160
right under his nose.

21:42.240 --> 21:43.900
It's this Zhang Yi'ang again.

21:44.400 --> 21:45.060
Where is he?

21:46.350 --> 21:47.080
May I come in?

21:48.600 --> 21:50.660
More evidence was found at the scene.

21:51.270 --> 21:52.000
Just in time.

21:56.240 --> 21:57.040
Who took this?

22:09.960 --> 22:10.560
Report...

22:11.240 --> 22:12.510
The... word after that is gone.

22:12.510 --> 22:14.110
It should be "Repot Letter."

22:14.270 --> 22:15.070
Repot Letter.

22:16.000 --> 22:16.830
My name is...

22:17.280 --> 22:19.580
[My name is...]

22:17.540 --> 22:18.340
It's missing.

22:18.350 --> 22:19.270
ID number...

22:19.550 --> 22:20.510
The last few digits are a bit blurry.

22:19.600 --> 22:21.340
[I hereby report, under my real name]

22:20.590 --> 22:21.790
The first few digits are missing.

22:21.790 --> 22:24.190
Why are all the important details missing?

22:27.360 --> 22:29.440
I hereby report, under my real name,

22:29.640 --> 22:30.880
that the death of Lu Zheng,

22:30.880 --> 22:32.750
Deputy Director
in charge of criminal investigation

22:32.750 --> 22:34.550
at Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau,

22:34.550 --> 22:35.410
six months ago,

22:37.680 --> 22:39.250
was not a traffic accident,

22:39.440 --> 22:40.130
but

22:40.160 --> 22:41.760
a carefully planned murder.

22:45.500 --> 22:46.700
At the bureau meeting

22:46.830 --> 22:48.270
of Sanjiangkou Municipal Bureau

22:48.270 --> 22:49.460
the following day,

22:50.310 --> 22:53.530
Director Zhang from
the Provincial Department implied that…

22:53.530 --> 22:55.790
Implied that it should be investigated
as a murder. But...

22:55.790 --> 22:57.850
Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau

22:59.510 --> 23:00.440
just went through the motions.

23:00.440 --> 23:01.160
He wrote this wrong.

23:01.160 --> 23:02.960
Went. Went through the motions.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.270
The mastermind behind

23:05.270 --> 23:06.670
this shocking case is...

23:08.750 --> 23:09.160
Who?

23:09.920 --> 23:10.380
The end.

23:12.200 --> 23:13.310
Just this one piece?

23:13.310 --> 23:15.570
This is the only piece found at the scene.

23:16.480 --> 23:18.640
It can't be a coincidence

23:18.720 --> 23:19.510
that this report letter was found

23:19.510 --> 23:20.840
at the explosion scene.

23:21.480 --> 23:22.350
Could this have been the suspect's purpose

23:22.350 --> 23:23.810
in causing the explosion?

23:25.240 --> 23:26.170
I don't think so.

23:27.270 --> 23:28.270
It's full of typos

23:28.310 --> 23:29.370
and makes no sense.

23:29.880 --> 23:31.940
Who writes a report letter like this?

23:35.590 --> 23:37.200
Although the person who wrote this letter

23:37.200 --> 23:38.160
doesn't seem to have a

23:38.160 --> 23:39.720
high education background,

23:39.720 --> 23:41.050
their purpose is clear.

23:41.480 --> 23:42.640
Is it possible that

23:43.750 --> 23:45.600
he wrote it under some sort of

23:45.680 --> 23:46.970
pressure or fear?

23:48.240 --> 23:50.500
Director Gao, do you have tweezers here?

24:02.070 --> 24:04.480
250174.

24:07.000 --> 24:08.330
Could it be an ID number?

24:10.110 --> 24:10.780
If...

24:10.830 --> 24:11.510
Based on these digits—

24:11.510 --> 24:13.200
if they are the first few digits
of an ID number—

24:13.200 --> 24:13.920
the informant is indeed

24:13.920 --> 24:14.980
from Sanjiangkou.

24:15.720 --> 24:16.230
How did you

24:16.230 --> 24:17.550
mess up the report letter like this?

24:17.550 --> 24:18.400
I didn't mean to.

24:18.400 --> 24:20.400
I didn't know it was a report letter.

24:21.830 --> 24:23.590
When Director Lu had his accident,

24:23.590 --> 24:25.390
you were in Sanjiangkou, right?

24:25.440 --> 24:25.880
Yes.

24:27.110 --> 24:28.710
Then how do you explain this?

24:29.920 --> 24:30.580
It's fishy.

24:31.960 --> 24:32.650
Well...

24:33.160 --> 24:33.790
who...

24:33.880 --> 24:35.210
is this Director Zhang?

24:37.750 --> 24:38.310
It's me.

24:41.400 --> 24:43.200
No matter what the situation is,

24:43.310 --> 24:45.400
the Provincial Department
is going to send someone down

24:45.400 --> 24:47.060
to serve as this deputy chief.

24:47.880 --> 24:49.950
We must investigate Lu Zheng's case

24:50.110 --> 24:51.010
thoroughly,

24:51.510 --> 24:53.370
so that no one has anything to say.

24:55.720 --> 24:56.320
Yan Liang.

24:58.200 --> 25:00.800
I don't have anyone
at this critical juncture.

25:05.550 --> 25:06.200
I thought

25:06.200 --> 25:08.590
only goldfish have a 7-second memory.

25:09.550 --> 25:10.460
The last time we robbed,

25:10.460 --> 25:12.190
we were inexperienced.

25:12.790 --> 25:13.650
We got nervous,

25:13.830 --> 25:16.630
didn't notice
the savings office's door opening,

25:16.720 --> 25:18.880
and just focused
on smashing the glass as planned.

25:18.880 --> 25:20.010
We didn't get a dime.

25:20.640 --> 25:22.300
This time I learned my lesson.

25:23.550 --> 25:25.240
After so many days of preparation,

25:25.240 --> 25:26.240
we found the target,

25:26.240 --> 25:28.040
and the robbery was successful.

25:28.590 --> 25:29.640
The shiny gold

25:29.640 --> 25:30.960
is right in front of us.

25:34.510 --> 25:36.040
But I am very disappointed.

25:36.270 --> 25:37.070
Because you

25:37.310 --> 25:39.310
didn't learn your lesson like I did.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.000
Why

25:40.000 --> 25:41.530
didn't you take more gold?

25:41.750 --> 25:42.680
Why did you stuff

25:42.680 --> 25:43.960
a 20-jin statue of the God of Wealth

25:43.960 --> 25:44.790
into your bag?

25:45.160 --> 25:45.880
Well, brother, I...

25:45.880 --> 25:47.030
It was placed in the middle,

25:47.030 --> 25:48.680
and I thought it looked quite valuable.

25:48.680 --> 25:49.480
It felt

25:49.790 --> 25:50.790
like Hetian jade.

25:51.000 --> 25:52.000
Hetian jade?

25:52.350 --> 25:54.480
A 20-jin piece of Hetian jade

25:54.830 --> 25:56.550
in a store the size of a fingernail?

25:56.550 --> 25:58.550
You think it was the Forbidden City?

25:58.550 --> 25:59.240
Well, at least

25:59.240 --> 26:00.880
it's the God of Wealth.

26:03.830 --> 26:04.720
Robbing a gold store

26:04.720 --> 26:06.960
and ending up taking a statue
of the God of Wealth—

26:06.960 --> 26:08.560
you're the only one in China.

26:09.640 --> 26:11.110
Come on. What's the big deal?

26:11.110 --> 26:12.730
We can just rob it again.

26:13.200 --> 26:14.200
It's just robbery.

26:14.200 --> 26:15.680
What's there to be afraid of?

26:15.680 --> 26:16.720
Heraclitus said,

26:16.720 --> 26:17.480
one cannot step

26:17.480 --> 26:19.000
into the same river twice.

26:20.260 --> 26:21.460
Wait, who is this guy?

26:21.590 --> 26:22.570
We made such a big scene.

26:22.570 --> 26:23.900
Do you dare to rob again?

26:26.200 --> 26:27.400
We are risking our lives to make money.

26:27.400 --> 26:29.400
If we slip up even slightly,
we'll end up in jail.

26:29.400 --> 26:30.800
We can't do this forever.

26:31.000 --> 26:32.000
Then what do we do?

26:40.550 --> 26:42.610
Neither of us has any special skills.

26:42.790 --> 26:43.790
Finding a proper job

26:43.790 --> 26:44.650
is impossible.

26:45.070 --> 26:45.960
Doing business—

26:45.960 --> 26:47.690
we're not cut out for it either.

26:49.240 --> 26:50.900
We need to change our mindset.

26:51.680 --> 26:52.550
Let's do something easy

26:52.550 --> 26:54.280
that doesn't require capital.

26:57.310 --> 26:58.310
Work the streets?

26:59.070 --> 27:00.110
Brother, I-I can't do it.

27:00.110 --> 27:01.110
Absolutely not.

27:01.160 --> 27:02.190
I can't do this.

27:02.400 --> 27:03.680
I mean, robbing stores won't work.

27:03.680 --> 27:05.080
Let's change direction.

27:05.790 --> 27:06.790
Let's rob people.

27:08.200 --> 27:09.330
Trafficking women?

27:09.550 --> 27:10.480
That's too wicked.

27:10.480 --> 27:11.240
I can't do that. I can't do that.

27:11.240 --> 27:11.720
I can't.

27:20.510 --> 27:22.500
[Confession from Prison: Lost Ten Millions
but Did Not Dare to Report]

27:23.160 --> 27:24.510
Ten million.

27:25.400 --> 27:26.740
How many stores do we have to rob

27:26.740 --> 27:28.560
to make 10 million?

27:27.370 --> 27:32.490
[Sanjiangkou Entertainment Newspaper]

27:29.480 --> 27:31.620
Robbing a corrupt official will do.

27:33.240 --> 27:35.240
Hurry up and pack. We're leaving tomorrow.

27:35.240 --> 27:35.800
Leave?

27:35.880 --> 27:36.350
Why?

27:36.920 --> 27:38.120
We're not staying here?

27:38.120 --> 27:39.300
Definitely not.

27:39.720 --> 27:40.590
What did that cop

27:40.590 --> 27:41.730
say today?

27:42.070 --> 27:42.960
Alright, don't linger here.

27:42.960 --> 27:44.290
It's dangerous. Go now.

27:47.960 --> 27:49.160
It's a hint from fate.

27:52.110 --> 27:53.000
Makes sense.

27:53.880 --> 27:55.610
So brother, where are we going?

27:58.310 --> 27:59.240
To Sanjiangkou.

28:00.000 --> 28:01.860
Rob a corrupt official, get rich,

28:02.770 --> 28:04.430
and make a name for ourselves.

28:05.750 --> 28:06.030
Brother,

28:06.030 --> 28:07.830
why are we going to Sanjiangkou?

28:09.160 --> 28:09.690
Brother,

28:09.880 --> 28:10.550
why?

28:13.330 --> 28:14.620
I just checked.

28:15.310 --> 28:16.310
Sanjiangkou is the only destination

28:16.310 --> 28:17.440
with 2 tickets left.

28:22.000 --> 28:23.450
It's all arranged

28:23.510 --> 28:25.160
by Heaven.

28:28.160 --> 28:28.960
Zhang Yi'ang.

28:29.350 --> 28:29.950
Come here.

28:35.030 --> 28:36.830
The Party Committee has decided

28:37.160 --> 28:38.290
that you will be sent

28:39.590 --> 28:40.520
to Sanjiangkou.

28:41.790 --> 28:42.960
I'm not from the CID.

28:43.160 --> 28:44.760
Can CID still spare someone?

28:46.960 --> 28:48.690
It's not that I don't want to go.

28:48.830 --> 28:50.310
I've just got a gout flare-up recently.

28:50.310 --> 28:51.040
I can't walk.

28:51.110 --> 28:52.510
How did you get in just now?

28:52.510 --> 28:53.480
Did you crawl in?

28:59.350 --> 29:00.150
Zhang Yi'ang.

29:04.110 --> 29:04.910
How many cases

29:05.550 --> 29:06.880
have you solved with me?

29:07.160 --> 29:08.090
Do you remember?

29:09.920 --> 29:11.380
You don't remember at all.

29:12.350 --> 29:13.030
I do.

29:16.000 --> 29:16.680
From...

29:18.000 --> 29:19.860
the serial murders on Fengqi Road

29:20.440 --> 29:22.070
to the White Elephant case we solved

29:22.070 --> 29:24.030
just before I was promoted
to deputy director—

29:24.030 --> 29:24.830
17 major cases

29:25.550 --> 29:26.200
in total.

29:30.110 --> 29:31.370
What does that tell us?

29:33.110 --> 29:34.070
It tells us

29:34.070 --> 29:35.930
your ability is beyond question,

29:36.480 --> 29:38.610
your political reliability is solid,

29:38.880 --> 29:40.080
and you're a fighter.

29:41.640 --> 29:44.030
You need to get back on your feet.

29:46.200 --> 29:46.830
Look at me!

29:49.000 --> 29:51.800
Yan Liang came to the bureau
at the same time as you.

29:52.510 --> 29:53.590
Look at him now.

29:53.640 --> 29:54.840
Now look at yourself.

29:55.830 --> 29:57.830
Do you even have friends left in CID?

29:58.440 --> 29:59.040
Or rather,

29:59.240 --> 30:00.160
Is there anyone in the CID

30:00.160 --> 30:01.640
who still considers you a friend?

30:01.640 --> 30:02.030
Yes.

30:04.070 --> 30:05.480
What accompanies me in my loneliness...

30:05.480 --> 30:06.480
is my loneliness.

30:07.440 --> 30:08.720
You can't go on like this.

30:08.720 --> 30:09.980
You'll ruin yourself.

30:09.980 --> 30:10.780
You know that?

30:20.240 --> 30:21.040
Zhang Yi'ang.

30:23.480 --> 30:24.400
Wasn't it just that incident 5 years ago,

30:24.400 --> 30:25.400
when the murderer jumped off a building,

30:25.400 --> 30:26.730
that affected you a bit?

30:27.680 --> 30:28.880
You can't get over it?

30:30.030 --> 30:31.830
What's that saying in football?

30:34.680 --> 30:35.080
Right.

30:35.350 --> 30:36.550
As an athlete,

30:36.590 --> 30:37.720
instead of playing,

30:37.830 --> 30:40.030
you just sit on the bench doing nothing?

30:40.750 --> 30:42.480
And you have the nerve to laugh?

30:42.680 --> 30:44.030
If I wasn't wearing this uniform,

30:44.030 --> 30:45.110
I'd smack you.

30:52.440 --> 30:53.370
I'm telling you.

30:54.440 --> 30:55.840
This is your last chance.

30:57.480 --> 30:58.540
Go to Sanjiangkou,

30:58.920 --> 31:00.350
take a temporary post
at the municipal bureau.

31:00.350 --> 31:01.030
investigate the case

31:01.030 --> 31:02.200
thoroughly,

31:02.540 --> 31:04.110
and close it cleanly.

31:05.720 --> 31:06.520
At most a year.

31:06.960 --> 31:08.440
I'll transfer you back within a year,

31:08.440 --> 31:10.160
and you'll be entrusted
with an important position.

31:10.160 --> 31:11.310
I have to go for a year?

31:11.310 --> 31:11.840
One year.

31:12.070 --> 31:13.240
Complete the mission,

31:13.240 --> 31:14.640
and don't cause trouble.

31:15.030 --> 31:15.830
Director Gao,

31:18.240 --> 31:19.080
do I have to go?

31:19.110 --> 31:19.720
Yes.

31:21.680 --> 31:22.790
Take Li Qian with you

31:22.790 --> 31:24.450
to Sanjiangkou to assist you.

31:25.790 --> 31:27.240
What mistake did she make?

31:27.240 --> 31:28.970
You think everyone is like you?

31:29.510 --> 31:31.040
That girl is very talented.

31:31.750 --> 31:33.680
The department plans
to make an exception and promote her.

31:33.680 --> 31:35.280
She needs a year of training.

31:35.450 --> 31:36.820
Keep an eye on her.

31:36.960 --> 31:38.110
Don't let anything happen to her.

31:38.110 --> 31:38.680
Got it?

31:44.200 --> 31:44.840
Go.

31:54.480 --> 31:55.280
What's wrong?

31:55.310 --> 31:56.030
Do you have something to say?

31:56.030 --> 31:57.000
No, I don't.

31:57.440 --> 31:58.310
Come back.

31:58.960 --> 31:59.720
Say what you want to say.

31:59.720 --> 32:00.650
Don't hold it in.

32:02.110 --> 32:02.960
I just feel

32:03.310 --> 32:04.310
this arrangement

32:05.440 --> 32:06.210
reminds me of

32:06.240 --> 32:06.920
a poem by Pushkin.

32:06.920 --> 32:07.880
I beg you,

32:08.110 --> 32:08.970
please,

32:09.000 --> 32:09.930
shut your mouth.

32:10.030 --> 32:11.000
If you recite poetry to me again,

32:11.000 --> 32:11.530
I will...

32:11.590 --> 32:13.000
Hurry up and get to Sanjiangkou!

32:13.000 --> 32:15.260
Don't come back until you close the case!

32:17.350 --> 32:18.640
I won't say too much.

32:18.880 --> 32:21.010
I'll wait for your triumphant return.

32:24.000 --> 32:25.200
Show what you've got.

32:25.350 --> 32:27.080
Let me see the old Zhang Yi'ang.

32:32.000 --> 32:32.600
Stay safe.

32:41.000 --> 32:41.480
Mentor.

32:41.750 --> 32:42.550
Get in the car!

32:45.300 --> 32:49.320
[Ping'an Province
National Safety Department]

32:50.160 --> 32:52.360
If life deceives you,

32:52.500 --> 32:53.660
don't be sad,

32:53.920 --> 32:54.920
don't be anxious.

32:55.000 --> 32:57.390
[Ping'an Province
National Safety Department]

32:55.160 --> 32:57.070
You need to stay calm in melancholy days.

32:57.070 --> 32:58.070
Happy days

32:58.590 --> 32:59.850
will eventually come!

33:38.350 --> 33:38.880
Brother,

33:39.440 --> 33:40.350
do you think this person will agree

33:40.350 --> 33:41.220
to change seats with me?

33:41.220 --> 33:42.420
I want to sit with you.

33:45.850 --> 33:48.250
Brother, you really know
how to enjoy life.

33:49.510 --> 33:51.240
Not only do I know how to enjoy life,

33:51.240 --> 33:52.840
but I also value friendship.

33:53.550 --> 33:54.550
Thanks, brother.

34:00.880 --> 34:01.410
Brother.

34:02.240 --> 34:02.770
Brother.

34:03.480 --> 34:04.010
Brother.

34:17.400 --> 34:18.150
Let's fight them.

34:18.150 --> 34:18.880
Yeah, right.

34:18.960 --> 34:19.489
Let's go.

34:30.550 --> 34:31.070
Here.

35:01.960 --> 35:02.710
Having you,

35:02.760 --> 35:05.110
a promising talent
from the Provincial Department,

35:05.110 --> 35:06.150
come with me—

35:07.880 --> 35:08.960
whatever happens in the future,

35:08.960 --> 35:10.890
I want to apologize in advance now.

35:13.360 --> 35:17.040
[Harmony]

35:37.430 --> 35:37.830
I...

35:38.280 --> 35:38.840
really haven't handled a case

35:38.840 --> 35:40.170
in many years.

35:40.510 --> 35:41.570
So I have to read it.

35:41.590 --> 35:44.360
Reviewing the past
helps understand the present.

35:44.360 --> 35:46.420
You carry a theory textbook with you.

35:47.230 --> 35:48.710
You are always prepared.

35:49.550 --> 35:50.800
You must have taken a lot of notes.

35:50.720 --> 35:50.920
[Index]

35:51.010 --> 35:52.000
[Retail]

35:53.930 --> 35:54.880
[Retail]

35:55.300 --> 35:55.780
[Criminal Psychology]

35:55.480 --> 35:57.030
This is a new edition.

35:57.060 --> 35:58.030
I bought a new one.

35:58.030 --> 35:59.550
No, it's an old edition.

36:00.150 --> 36:00.960
When I was in school,

36:00.960 --> 36:01.800
I studied from this edition.

36:01.040 --> 36:02.130
[Criminal Psychology]

36:02.850 --> 36:03.710
When I was in school,

36:03.710 --> 36:04.720
this edition didn't exist.

36:04.720 --> 36:05.710
So to me,

36:05.710 --> 36:06.550
it is new.

36:07.930 --> 36:08.370
[Index]

36:08.490 --> 36:10.150
[Chapter 1: Nightclub Murder Case]

36:10.150 --> 36:10.740
[Police]

36:11.030 --> 36:11.960
Director Zhang,

36:12.230 --> 36:13.590
I have a question.

36:13.670 --> 36:14.530
I'm listening.

36:15.280 --> 36:17.280
Director Gao said that when Chief Lu

36:17.320 --> 36:19.070
had his accident, you were in Sanjiangkou

36:19.070 --> 36:21.130
and personally involved in the case.

36:23.840 --> 36:24.700
This matter...

36:25.450 --> 36:26.310
is a long story.

36:28.500 --> 36:30.070
Chief Lu had the habit of taking a walk

36:30.070 --> 36:31.400
after dinner every day.

36:31.840 --> 36:33.370
It rained heavily that day.

36:34.320 --> 36:35.850
He was in a hurry to get home.

36:38.630 --> 36:39.230
I doubt it.

36:42.280 --> 36:43.550
I doubt it. I doubt it.

36:44.480 --> 36:46.480
I doubt it. I doubt it. I doubt it.

36:47.920 --> 36:48.510
Zhang.

36:49.440 --> 36:50.760
Last night, I rushed to the scene

36:50.760 --> 36:51.870
immediately.

36:52.150 --> 36:53.840
After careful investigation,

36:53.840 --> 36:55.670
it was confirmed to be
just a traffic accident.

36:55.670 --> 36:57.110
It couldn't be a criminal case.

36:57.110 --> 36:59.170
There's nothing to be suspicious of.

37:00.960 --> 37:01.720
So,

37:01.840 --> 37:03.840
it was determined to be an accident.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.290
Director Zhang.

37:10.880 --> 37:11.940
How are you going to

37:12.000 --> 37:13.130
take the first step?

37:15.030 --> 37:15.440
Right.

37:16.710 --> 37:17.970
Where should we start?

37:18.670 --> 37:20.920
Chief Lu's case
has already been concluded.

37:20.920 --> 37:22.030
Going there to investigate

37:22.030 --> 37:23.360
with such great fanfare

37:23.840 --> 37:24.550
will definitely cause dissatisfaction

37:24.550 --> 37:26.410
among the police in Sanjiangkou.

37:26.760 --> 37:28.820
How about we intervene mildly first

37:29.590 --> 37:31.520
with routine internal inquiries?

37:34.630 --> 37:37.000
We can't just
go through the motions either,

37:37.000 --> 37:39.400
otherwise it'll be hard
to explain to my mentor.

37:39.400 --> 37:40.030
Whether or not

37:40.030 --> 37:41.030
we find new clues,

37:41.710 --> 37:42.750
we will conduct

37:42.840 --> 37:44.370
targeted investigations.

37:48.510 --> 37:49.000
Li Qian.

37:49.960 --> 37:51.400
When Director Gao introduced you to me,

37:51.400 --> 37:51.880
he said

37:52.000 --> 37:54.000
you are quick-witted and talented.

37:54.440 --> 37:55.510
From now on,

37:55.510 --> 37:57.370
share your thoughts with me more.

38:02.700 --> 38:03.630
Director Zhang.

38:04.550 --> 38:05.360
Your arrival in Sanjiangkou

38:05.360 --> 38:07.090
will definitely bring clarity

38:07.480 --> 38:08.480
to the situation.

38:10.780 --> 38:11.510
Get to the bottom

38:11.510 --> 38:12.710
of this case.

38:12.780 --> 38:14.260
I want everyone to know

38:14.840 --> 38:16.110
that you, Zhang Yi'ang,

38:16.110 --> 38:17.000
are absolutely not a

38:17.000 --> 38:18.590
good-for-nothing loser.

38:21.670 --> 38:22.440
I hope so.

38:32.930 --> 38:38.170
[Warning: High Voltage. No Water Spraying]

38:44.010 --> 38:46.170
♪ This city is called Sanjiangkou ♪

38:46.240 --> 38:48.520
♪ When I first arrived,
no one here shared my vibe ♪

38:48.590 --> 38:51.050
♪ Some people need help
to pull off big plans ♪

38:51.180 --> 38:53.760
♪ Burning their brains
just to chase both fame and fortune ♪

38:51.730 --> 38:53.580
[I hereby report, under my real name]

38:53.860 --> 38:56.100
♪ A crowded place full of all kinds of people,
picky and harsh ♪

38:56.150 --> 38:58.500
♪ Some are starving and resort
to shady tricks behind the scenes ♪

38:58.610 --> 39:00.700
♪ Twisted clues make my thoughts a mess ♪

39:00.780 --> 39:03.290
♪ Without real skills,
how do you crack dirty deals ♪

39:03.320 --> 39:05.420
♪ Old foxes with deep schemes ♪

39:05.500 --> 39:07.890
♪ Spotting fools
digging their own graves ♪

39:07.960 --> 39:10.630
♪ The weak fear the strong,
the strong fear the reckless ♪

39:10.700 --> 39:13.100
♪ But if everyone's reckless,
how do you even compete ♪

39:13.170 --> 39:15.230
♪ I took the job,
now they're all on the losing side ♪

39:15.310 --> 39:17.730
♪ My strange ideas
may look a bit over the top ♪

39:17.820 --> 39:20.080
♪ Even if I'm still a little confused
by sudden changes ♪

39:20.180 --> 39:22.680
♪ I ride a dark horse into the night ♪

39:22.750 --> 39:27.140
♪ Low IQ adventuring in Sanjiangkou,
strike in the dark then slip away over the wall ♪

39:27.240 --> 39:31.890
♪ In the fog of Sanjiangkou,
are you a dragon or just a worm ♪

39:30.190 --> 39:34.370
[Sanjiangkou]

39:31.950 --> 39:36.830
♪ Under currents surging in Sanjiangkou,
no stopping until the goal is reached ♪

39:36.920 --> 39:41.610
♪ I've arrived at Sanjiangkou,
so tell me where you're heading ♪

39:41.700 --> 39:44.350
♪ Big fish eat small fish,
small fish eat shrimp ♪

39:44.430 --> 39:46.460
♪ And shrimp end up buried in the mud ♪

39:46.550 --> 39:49.270
♪ Big mysteries within small ones,
small ones hiding deeper secrets ♪

39:49.320 --> 39:51.180
♪ Not everything is just a cheap trick ♪

39:51.250 --> 39:53.730
♪ Accidental twists
that turn oddly funny ♪

39:53.800 --> 39:55.890
♪ Threads tangled everywhere,
nothing but confusion ♪

39:56.020 --> 39:58.360
♪ But one day the fog will clear ♪

39:58.460 --> 40:01.110
♪ And the sky will open
to reveal the moon ♪

40:01.190 --> 40:03.070
♪ Mystery City, mystery City ♪

40:03.090 --> 40:05.860
♪ I slowly uncover secrets no one knew ♪

40:05.950 --> 40:07.850
♪ Mystery City, mystery City ♪

40:07.910 --> 40:10.270
♪ It takes more than effort.
you've got to think ♪

40:10.360 --> 40:12.860
♪ I didn't just stumble in.
Let me explain ♪

40:12.940 --> 40:15.000
♪ Every move I make
looks calculated and sharp ♪

40:15.070 --> 40:17.500
♪ Even with few clues,
though it's frustrating ♪

40:17.570 --> 40:20.450
♪ I still manage to perform at my best ♪

40:20.500 --> 40:22.610
♪ Stay clear-headed.
Don't get led around by the nose ♪

40:22.690 --> 40:25.000
♪ Could be spontaneous,
could be carefully planned ♪

40:25.060 --> 40:27.290
♪ Things you can't trace or solve
aren't that hard at all ♪

40:27.360 --> 40:29.950
♪ If you're a tiger, lie down.
If you're a dragon, coil up ♪

40:30.000 --> 40:32.180
♪ Everyone hides motives,
but nobody's that smart ♪

40:32.250 --> 40:34.390
♪ Bold deductions
are enough to lock the target ♪

40:34.460 --> 40:36.760
♪ Solving big cases
isn't just luck ♪

40:36.840 --> 40:39.710
♪ Don't play tricks.
I've got better moves ♪

